# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ECLIPSE — Cross-platform UE 5.6 .gitignore
# Mac + PC developers share the same repo. Each platform
# regenerates its own build artifacts locally.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── UE generated build artifacts (both platforms) ──
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
**/*/Saved/
# The root Saved/ is ignored by its CONTENTS (Saved/*) rather than as a
# directory, because git refuses to re-include anything under an excluded
# directory — the parent has to stay visible for the exception below to work.
Saved/*
!Saved/UnrealBuildTool/
Saved/UnrealBuildTool/*
# The one exception: project-scope UBT settings, shared across the team.
!Saved/UnrealBuildTool/BuildConfiguration.xml

# ── PC / Visual Studio ──
.vs/
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.user
*.userosscache
*.usertasks


# ── Mac / Xcode ──
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
xcuserdata/
*.xccheckout
*.xcscmblueprint

# ── IDE / editor metadata ──
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── OS junk ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ── Local-only files ──
LocalNotes.md
*.local.*
*.log

# ── Plugins compiled binaries (keep source, ignore output) ──
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/
CLAUDE.md

# ── ArticyXImporter CSV debug dumps ──
# The .uasset files alongside these (Eclipse_*Database.uasset etc.) are the
# actual runtime data — these CSVs are a redundant debug artifact regenerated
# on every reimport, and trigger UE's "DataTable Options" auto-import dialog.
# Generated C++ headers (Source/eclipse/ArticyGenerated/*.h) and Articy
# .uasset databases ARE committed so teammates can build + play without
# reimporting after every pull.
Content/ArticyContent/Generated/All_objects.csv
Content/L10N/*/ArticyContent/Generated/All_objects.csv

# ── Agent / working notes ──
# CLAUDE.md is ignored above for the same reason: these are scratch context
# for AI sessions and running task lists, not project history.
TODO.md

# ── Local tool config ──
# Points at a localhost MCP endpoint, so it's per-machine rather than shared.
.mcp.json

# ── Screenshots dropped in the project root ──
# macOS names these per-locale, hence the two spellings.
Captura de pantalla*.png
Screenshot*.png
Screen Shot*.png

# ── Prototypes living inside the project folder ──
# Neither belongs to the UE project. dungeon-prototype/ is its own git repo —
# committing it would add a gitlink that clones as an empty directory.
ClubDungeon/
dungeon-prototype/
